WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.872
Kublai was Genghis Khan's grandson, and he harboured great ambitions.

00:00:05.222 --> 00:00:11.054
His gaze turned toward the distance, his heart thinking of the future of the realm.

00:00:11.404 --> 00:00:15.220
In the year 1271, 'Great Yuan' became the new dynastic name.

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:19.818
Civil and military officials gathered in one hall; the ceremony was most grand.

00:00:20.168 --> 00:00:25.424
The Yuan dynasty was formally founded, and Kublai became Emperor Shizu of Yuan.

00:00:25.774 --> 00:00:29.374
The new palace stood tall and magnificent.

00:00:29.724 --> 00:00:34.764
At court he valued talented people of every people and carried out new institutions.

00:00:35.114 --> 00:00:40.802
Talented people from every people could each put their strengths to use.

00:00:41.152 --> 00:00:45.064
The Yuan armies continued south and gradually unified China.

00:00:45.414 --> 00:00:48.438
The great host advanced southward in mighty array.

00:00:48.788 --> 00:00:52.028
A new dynasty rose in the east.

00:00:52.378 --> 00:00:55.714
The morning sun rose and lit up the palace.

